CORE
main.c
--k-induction --multi-property --max-k-step 5
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^\s+FAILED\s+\[main\.assertion\.1\]\s+line\s+10\s+assertion x < 3$
^\s+UNKNOWN\s+\[main\.assertion\.2\]\s+line\s+11\s+assertion x != 100 \(inductive step could not prove this claim\)$
^\*\* 1 of 2 properties failed, 1 unknown$
\A(?![\s\S]*VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL)[\s\S]*\Z
